[516.97232, "o", "\r\n\r\n"]
[517.137616, "o", "\u001b[37m```\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[37mremote: Repository not found.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[37mfatal: Authentication failed for 'https://github.com/example-user/research-profile.git/'\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[37m```\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[37mBefore\u001b[0m"]
